{"path":"container/span/as_bytes","title":"std::as_bytes, std::as_writable_bytes","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>as_bytes, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>as_writable_bytes","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/span/as_bytes","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Obtains a view to the object representation of the elements of the span s.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/span\">&lt;span&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> N <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span\"><span class=\"kw2648\">std::<span class=\"me2\">span</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/byte\"><span class=\"kw2657\">std::<span class=\"me2\">byte</span></span></a>, S<span class=\"coMULTI\">/* see below */</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; as_bytes<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/span\"><span class=\"kw2648\">std::<span class=\"me2\">span</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>T, N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> s <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"k